{%- comment -%}
  llms.txt — AI Crawler Discoverability Layer
  surgeonsolution.io — CBD Surgeons & Surgeons, LLC

  This snippet renders an AI-readable site summary directly in the HTML.
  Since Shopify doesn't allow arbitrary root files (like /llms.txt),
  we embed the content in a hidden, semantic <script type="application/llms+txt">
  block and a complementary JSON-LD KnowledgeBase schema that AI crawlers parse.

  AI crawlers (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot, Google-Extended, Bingbot)
  consume this to understand the site's identity, authority, and content structure.
{%- endcomment -%}

